If Locking happens in ODS and If we have to reset the all then follow below steps

1. STOP the service first
	TS,RAD I MEB.B.ODS.EXT.TRANS
	
2. Check if all agents have stopped
	TSA.STATUS
	L L 
	SERVICE.NAME EQ MEB.B.ODS.EXT.TRANS
	
	if any agents are still running then mark as stopped from backend
	JED F.TSA.STATUS ID
	
3.	Take the back up of temp folder and clear it
	F:\T24\Interface\ODSDATA\TEMP
	
4. Clear the Job list related to ODS service
   CLEAR-FILE JOB.LIST.ID
   Ex: CLEAR-FILE F.JOB.LIST.104
   
5. Delete F.LOCKING record for ODS
   JED F.LOCKING LOCKING.ID
   JED F.LOCKING MEB.B.ODS.EXT.TRANS-MEB.B.ODS.EXT.TRANS-1
   then d and Y
   
6. Delete F.BATCH.STATUS record for ODS
   JED F.BATCH.STATUS MEB.B.ODS.EXT.TRANS-MEB.B.ODS.EXT.TRANS-1
   then d and Y
   
7. Reset batch record
   JED F.BATCH MEB.B.ODS.EXT.TRANS
   mark 3 and 12.1 field as 0.
   
8. Setup PARAM table if required. (Command available above)

